":"custom-liquid","custom_css":[".fr-row {width: 100%; max-width: 1200px;}",".fr-col {width: 50%; float: left; text-align: left;}",".fr-col dt {font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 10px;}",".fr-col dd {padding-bottom: 15px;}",".gf_google-container {height: 400px;}","@media screen and (max-width: 699px) {.fr-col {width: 100% !important; float: none; }}"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"remove_vertical_spacing":false,"remove_horizontal_spacing":false,"liquid":"<section>\n<div class=\"fr_row\">\n<div class=\"fr-col\">\n<dl>\n<dt>営業時間<\/dt>\n<dd>店舗営業時間: 11:00〜21:00<br>\n※RAYARD MIYASHITA PARKの営業時間に準ずる \n<\/dd>\n<dt>アクセス<\/dt>\n<dd>MIYASHITA PARK South2階<br>\n住所: 東京都渋谷区神宮前6-20-10　<br>\n※渋谷駅から徒歩3分\n<\/dd>\n<dt>電話番号<\/dt>\n<dd>TEL：03-6450-6588<\/dd>\n<\/dl> \n<\/div>\n<div class=\"fr-col\">\n<div class=\"gf_google-container\">\n<iframe style=\"height:100%\" src=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps?q=%E6%9D%B1%E4%BA%AC%E9%83%BD%E6%B8%8B%E8%B0%B7%E5%8C%BA%E7%A5%9E%E5%AE%AE%E5%89%8D6-20-10&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=&amp;t=m&amp;z=14&amp;\" width=\"100%\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe>\n<div class=\"gf_gmaps-overlay\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n<style>\n<\/style>","text_alignment":"center"}},"91859f82-eedc-4426-a516-276187c40fd2":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"template--17091280437500__91859f82-eedc-4426-a516-276187c40fd2-image_with_text-1":{"type":"image_with_text","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/14-080_1.png","title":"","heading_tag":"h3","content":"","link_url":"","link_text":""}},"template--17091280437500__91859f82-eedc-4426-a516-276187c40fd2-image_with_text-2":{"type":"image_with_text","settings":{"title":"<strong>エアーライトジャケット　グレージュ<\/strong>","heading_tag":"h3","content":"<p>KAPOK KNOTの人気No.1アイテム「エアーライトジャケット」のMIYASHITA PARK限定色「グレージュ」が販売中です。<\/p><p>グレージュは「グレーとベージュ、両者の良さを取り入れた色」と表現されるため、KAPOK KNOTの新コンセプト“Blur the Line”を体現する色。新店オープンという特別なタイミングで発売する「エアーライトジャケット」の初の新色を、ぜひこの機会にご覧ください。<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":""}}},"block_order":["template--17091280437500__91859f82-eedc-4426-a516-276187c40fd2-image_with_text-1","template--17091280437500__91859f82-eedc-4426-a516-276187c40fd2-image_with_text-2"],"custom_css":[".color-scheme {background-color: #fff6ed; color: #000;}","@media screen and (max-width: 699px) {.multi-column {grid: none; }}"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-3","separate_section_with_border":true,"columns_per_row":2,"stack_on_mobile":true,"overlap_image":false,"content_alignment":"center","text_alignment":"start","spacing":"xs","subheading":"","title":"<strong>MIYASHITA PARK STORE限定商品が登場<\/strong>","content":""}},"2a893685-7642-4eb5-84cb-82c0a0d37475":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--17091280437500__2a893685-7642-4eb5-84cb-82c0a0d37475-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"<strong>KNOT LAB<\/strong>","heading_tag":"h3"}},"template--17091280437500__2a893685-7642-4eb5-84cb-82c0a0d37475-subheading-1":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":"「つくる」と「つかう」をつなぐラボ"}},"template--17091280437500__2a893685-7642-4eb5-84cb-82c0a0d37475-richtext-1":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>KAPOK KNOT MIYASHITA PARK STOREでは、商品をご覧いただけるのはもちろん、<br\/>カポックノットの魅力をたっぷり体験できるコンテンツを用意しています。<br\/><br\/>こちらのページでは、ものづくりへのこだわりや、<br\/>カポックがなぜたった5mmでダウンの暖かさを再現できたのか、<br\/>その秘密を一緒に探るツアーへお申込みいただけます。<\/p>"}},"5bf9b3fa-d24b-4842-83a5-12d583347374":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p><strong>こちらは予約制の体験コンテンツのご案内となります。<br\/>KNOT LABをご予約いただくことで、<br\/>より深くKAPOK KNOTの魅力を感じていただくことができます。<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>※通常のご来店・ご試着はご予約不要です。<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>KNOT LAB予約時間 11:30-20:30<\/strong><\/p>"}},"48008e60-203a-4771-8647-62087b3b036a":{"type":"button","settings":{"style":"solid","text":"予約に進む","url":"","background":"","text_color":""}}},"block_order":["template--17091280437500__2a893685-7642-4eb5-84cb-82c0a0d37475-heading-1","template--17091280437500__2a893685-7642-4eb5-84cb-82c0a0d37475-subheading-1","template--17091280437500__2a893685-7642-4eb5-84cb-82c0a0d37475-richtext-1","5bf9b3fa-d24b-4842-83a5-12d583347374","48008e60-203a-4771-8647-62087b3b036a"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"content_width":"xs","text_position":"center","remove_vertical_spacing":false}},"custom_liquid_fjniGQ":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"remove_vertical_spacing":false,"remove_horizontal_spacing":false,"liquid":"<div class=\"appointo-custom-btn\" data-appointo-product-handle=\"miyashitaparkshowroom\" type=\"embed\"><\/div>","text_alignment":"center"}},"7c5d0d94-1352-482b-bbcf-9f1fcaa07a23":{"type":"text-with-icons","blocks":{"template--17091280437500__7c5d0d94-1352-482b-bbcf-9f1fcaa07a23-item-1":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-calendar","icon_width":24,"mobile_icon_width":24,"title":"<strong>ご希望の日時をお選びください。<\/strong>","content":"<p>「予約に進む」ボタンからご希望の日時を選び「カートに入れる」を選択してください。<\/p>"}},"template--17091280437500__7c5d0d94-1352-482b-bbcf-9f1fcaa07a23-item-2":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-bag-handle","icon_width":24,"mobile_icon_width":24,"title":"<strong>ご購入手続きをお進みください。<\/strong>","content":"<p>「ご購入手続きへ」進み、必要事項をご記入後「お支払いへ進む」を選択してください。<\/p>"}},"template--17091280437500__7c5d0d94-1352-482b-bbcf-9f1fcaa07a23-item-3":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-send","icon_width":24,"mobile_icon_width":24,"title":"<strong>ご予約完了<\/strong>","content":"<p>ご注文完了画面までお進みいただきましたら、ご予約が完了しております。<br\/><strong><br\/>ご登録いただきましたメールアドレス宛に、「Appointment Confirmed:（お名前）」というメールが届きますのでご確認ください。<\/strong><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--17091280437500__7c5d0d94-1352-482b-bbcf-9f1fcaa07a23-item-1","template--17091280437500__7c5d0d94-1352-482b-bbcf-9f1fcaa07a23-item-2","template--17091280437500__7c5d0d94-1352-482b-bbcf-9f1fcaa07a23-item-3"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"stack_on_mobile":false,"icon_color":"","text_color":"","text_alignment":"start"}},"b11836a4-11a7-4ba1-ac74-029350256110":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"bec28fa9-8b1d-48b0-b513-e0e43a1da6cd":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2023-12-28_12.42.10.png","width_mode":"full_width","max_width":600,"mobile_max_width":400}}},"block_order":["bec28fa9-8b1d-48b0-b513-e0e43a1da6cd"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"content_width":"sm","text_position":"center","remove_vertical_spacing":false}},"3f71515f-5a9c-428d-a17d-cd3752050f1e":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--17091280437500__3f71515f-5a9c-428d-a17d-cd3752050f1e-subheading-1":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":"Study 01"}},"template--17091280437500__3f71515f-5a9c-428d-a17d-cd3752050f1e-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Kapok Material","heading_tag":"h3"}},"template--17091280437500__3f71515f-5a9c-428d-a17d-cd3752050f1e-richtext-1":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>木の実から採れるインドネシア原産の高機能な新素材「カポック」<br\/><br\/>軽くて暖かいアウターになるまでの秘密をみなさんだけにお伝えします。実物のカポックにさわってみたり、他の素材と比べてみたり、顕微鏡で覗いてみたり。素材を全身で体感してみてください<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--17091280437500__3f71515f-5a9c-428d-a17d-cd3752050f1e-subheading-1","template--17091280437500__3f71515f-5a9c-428d-a17d-cd3752050f1e-heading-1","template--17091280437500__3f71515f-5a9c-428d-a17d-cd3752050f1e-richtext-1"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2023-12-28_12.43.36.png","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"start","content_width":"sm","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"8d814dde-9e17-4c52-807c-fbe541ccd368":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--17091280437500__8d814dde-9e17-4c52-807c-fbe541ccd368-subheading-1":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":"Study 02"}},"template--17091280437500__8d814dde-9e17-4c52-807c-fbe541ccd368-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Brand Story","heading_tag":"h3"}},"template--17091280437500__8d814dde-9e17-4c52-807c-fbe541ccd368-richtext-1":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>カポックノットは、素材「カポック」との出会いから始まりました。世界第二位の汚染産業であるアパレル業界の中で、大量生産大量廃棄のシステムや、作り手に負担の多いサプライチェーンをどうしたら変えられるのか。<br\/><br\/>カポックノットが作り手の現場に自ら赴き、見えた世界を一緒に探検しましょう。<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--17091280437500__8d814dde-9e17-4c52-807c-fbe541ccd368-subheading-1","template--17091280437500__8d814dde-9e17-4c52-807c-fbe541ccd368-heading-1","template--17091280437500__8d814dde-9e17-4c52-807c-fbe541ccd368-richtext-1"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2023-12-28_12.43.45.png","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"end","content_width":"sm","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"cf84ce15-f16b-4443-b47f-24e654344ac1":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--17091280437500__cf84ce15-f16b-4443-b47f-24e654344ac1-subheading-1":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":"Study 03"}},"template--17091280437500__cf84ce15-f16b-4443-b47f-24e654344ac1-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Farm to Fashion","heading_tag":"h3"}},"template--17091280437500__cf84ce15-f16b-4443-b47f-24e654344ac1-richtext-1":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>赤道直下のインドネシア。乾いた風を受けて向かう農園で見た景色は広大な大地に根付くカポックでした。<br\/><br\/>カポックたちは、農家の人の手で取り出され、中国で加工されます。<br\/>日本でシートは縫製工場のつくり手たちによって丁寧に縫合されます。設立当初から大切にしていた”Farm to Fashion”のスピリットをぜひ体感してみてください。<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--17091280437500__cf84ce15-f16b-4443-b47f-24e654344ac1-subheading-1","template--17091280437500__cf84ce15-f16b-4443-b47f-24e654344ac1-heading-1","template--17091280437500__cf84ce15-f16b-4443-b47f-24e654344ac1-richtext-1"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2023-12-28_12.43.56.png","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"start","content_width":"sm","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"cc889814-93e7-4fe8-83d7-98164cd8b8a1":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"ba5dc21e-6c3c-4f46-bbac-fcdd82f9c26c":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2023-12-28_12.49.23.png","width_mode":"full_width","max_width":6